1. RGB to Hyperspectral reconstruction via fine-tuned MST++ transformers.
2. Pesticide residue triage using the Model 2 Hybrid XGBoost classifier.
3. Quality validation via a Routing Gate (CLIP) and confidence thresholding.

The app supports three modes:
- Upload a photo: Full end-to-end triage of a user-provided image.
- Compare with real HSI: Evaluation against the Agro-HSR test set.
- Compare checkpoints: Qualitative analysis of domain adaptation (A vs B vs C).
"""
